{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经Rclone疑似外泄数据。对应需求：数据外泄。官方：Potential Data Exfiltration via Rclone。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经Rclone疑似外泄数据","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经Rclone疑似外泄数据\n\n### 为何重要\n把数据带出主机或网络\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","references":["https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1048/","https://rclone.org/commands/rclone_copy/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"3f4c2b18-9d2e-4b7a-a3c1-8e6d9f2b5c7e","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 数据外泄","来源: 默认","对应需求: 数据外泄"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n (process.name : \"rclone.exe\" or ?process.pe.original_file_name == \"rclone.exe\") and process.args : (\"copy\", \"sync\") and\n  not process.args : (\"--config=?:\\\\Program Files\\\\rclone\\\\config\\\\rclone\\\\rclone.conf\", \"--config=?:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\rclone\\\\config\\\\rclone\\\\rclone.conf\") and \n  not process.executable : (\"?:\\\\Program Files*\", \"\\\\Device\\\\HarddiskVolume*\\\\Program Files*\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1048","name":"Exfiltration Over Alternative Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1048/"},{"id":"T1567","name":"Exfiltration Over Web Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1567/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1567.002","name":"Exfiltration to Cloud Storage","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1567/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0010","name":"Exfiltration","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0010/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1036","name":"Masquerading","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1036.003","name":"Rename Legitimate Utilities","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":5,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
